 },
 "turns": [
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "It's the toenail. Thick and yellow. Six months."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "He won't say, but it's embarrassing him, doctor. I'm his wife, Basia. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Hello, both. Which toe? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Right big toe."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Is it crumbling?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Yes. Bits come off in my socks."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Does it hurt?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "In shoes, yes. Sore."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "He limps when he wears the brown ones. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any itching between the toes?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "A bit. Between the little ones."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Smell?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "Terrible, I'll say it."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Basia. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any redness spreading up the foot?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Fever?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No fever."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Nurse, did you get his obs?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_4",
   "t": "Yes, blood pressure 136 over 82, pulse 70, weight 78 kilos."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Thanks. Has he tried anything on it?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Nothing. Just cutting it. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any allergies, to medicines or anything?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No allergies."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "What about that tablet for the toenail, years ago? He came out in a rash. I don't remember its name."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "That wasn't an allergy."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I'll note both. Medical history?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Athlete's foot. Psoriasis. Gout."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Operations?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Knee replacement, 2017. Cataract, 2020."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Skin problems in the family?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "My brother has psoriasis."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And your work?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Retired. Postman."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Smoke?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Never smoked."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Drink?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "A pint at the pub on Fridays."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Exercise?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "He walks the dog every morning."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Let me see the foot. Take the sock off.",
   "pause": 10.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "There. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "The right big toenail is thick and yellow, and there's crumbly debris underneath it."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "Is it bad? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And there's scaling between the toes on the same foot."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Told you. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any problem with the circulation, cold feet?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No, nothing, my feet are warm."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any numbness in the feet?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No, nothing like that."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "This could well be a fungal infection of the nail, but I can't rule out nail psoriasis, given your history."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "How do we tell? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I'd like to send a nail clipping to the lab, and I'd also like to do a skin scraping from between the toes."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Fine. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And I'd like to arrange a liver blood test, in case we need tablets later."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "Not the tablet that gave him the rash? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "No, let's start with a nail lacquer, amorolfine, painted on once a week."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Okay. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I'd like to see you again in six weeks."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "We'll be here. ~"
  }
